-- When a nested object omits a property listed in its `required` array, the rejection names the complete failing property path ([validated by: names the complete nested path when a required property is missing](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.test.ts#L55), [validated by: reports the parent path before a nested required property](../../src/orchestration/tools/registry.test.ts#L81)).
